{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Normalize sampling into the documented half-open interval**\n\nDividing by the maximum unsigned 32-bit value maps `0xffffffff` to exactly `1.0`, producing `[0,1]` rather than `[0,1)` and shifting deterministic sampling boundaries. Coordinate the denominator with the other SDKs, divide by `2^32`, and add fixed-vector compatibility tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7nh9gW","finding_digest":"e7d59d7f97adf9275b8c6059f365d1f81f01b4bd532c18412ba85b880824af36","finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","line":391,"observation_digest":"765e81c7c853702c2f7bbc514d235586bedcdc389ff6e06941485a640538ba19","observation_id":"aro_v1_ozpidr6iknycyl33xriu2i2vq2","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","published_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:11Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5xididmhluq4mhdhugntjpm257","reviewed_base_sha":"6501c39f553655583e33238eb1d821e4f44b8e26","reviewed_head_sha":"bdbd88fcdf777f50567d968c0e73fa11c8eb39ad","reviewer":"codex","start_line":391,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_vv4dgq7qztgqpxcnbxkm5zavd6"},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_z4344kjq4jqctuaxnbty4k445w","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:11Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
